      "content": "It's important to prioritize your health, so it's best to clean the wound thoroughly. Rinse the area under running water and use a clean cloth or paper towel to remove any large debris. Apply an antiseptic solution to prevent infection. Cover it with a sterile bandage and change it daily. However, please consult a medical professional to ensure proper wound care and to rule out any serious issues. Your safety should be first.",
